    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>terrain-rgb-decode-decode · 4×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1024 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-terrain-terrain-rgb-decode-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-terrain-terrain-rgb-decode-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const inputWordsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; inputWords: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const outputValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const outputValidityOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValidity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const WIDTH: u32 = 32u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const HEIGHT: u32 = 32u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">fn isEncodedPixelValid(red: u32, green: u32, blue: u32, alpha: u32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">  if (alpha == 0u) { return false; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">  return true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">// Integer code N = R * 65536 + G * 256 + B &lt; 2^24, then exactly one float operation sequence.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">fn decodeHeight(red: u32, green: u32, blue: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  let code = (red &lt;&lt; 16u) | (green &lt;&lt; 8u) | blue;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  return f32(code) * 0.00390625 - 32768.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">fn isHeightInRange(height: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  return height &gt;= -11000.0 &amp;&amp; height &lt;= 9000.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">fn applySeaClamp(height: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  return height;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"31\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"32\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  _ = &amp;inputWords;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  _ = &amp;outputValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  _ = &amp;outputValidity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  let pixelIndex = index;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  let word = inputWords[inputWordsOffset + pixelIndex];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let red = word &amp; 0xffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let green = (word &gt;&gt; 8u) &amp; 0xffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  let blue = (word &gt;&gt; 16u) &amp; 0xffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let alpha = word &gt;&gt; 24u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  var isValid = isEncodedPixelValid(red, green, blue, alpha);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  let height = decodeHeight(red, green, blue);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  isValid = isValid &amp;&amp; isHeightInRange(height);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  outputValidity[outputValidityOffset + pixelIndex] = select(0u, 1u, isValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  outputValues[outputValuesOffset + pixelIndex] =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">    select(bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (pixelIndex &amp; 0u)), applySeaClamp(height), isValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>inputWords<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"terrariumRGBA\">terrariumRGBA</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"decodedElevation\">decodedElevation</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValidity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"decodedValidity\">decodedValidity</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUTerrainRGBDecode/terrarium-buffer · main · bfd8e7cd</figcaption></figure></section>",
